            </note>
            <note corresp="#d737-f3" n="4" xml:id="d737-f3-content">
                <p>Agreement by exchange of notes signed August 6, 1936, renewing agreements of
                    February 26 and August 7, 1935; for text, see Venezuela, <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Gaceta Oficial</hi>, August 8, 1936.</p>
            </note>
